    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct absolute F measurement for the query or alfentanil in the supplied records.",
    "L3 oral AUC/Cmax records for fentanyl/LASSBio-1736 lack an IV comparator, so they cannot quantify F.",
    "L5/L6 gut-wall and hepatic metabolism records are for fentanyl/alfentanil/carfentanil, not the query's exact thiophene-substituted analog.",
    "No direct solubility or dissolution data for the query; high logP suggests possible solubility limitation but ionization may mitigate it.",
    "No human F data for the thiophene-substituted analog."
